# This machine has core.autocrlf=true. Without this file git would rewrite the
# working tree to CRLF, which breaks three things in this repo:
#   - the byte-for-byte comparison between .env.example and
#     tooling/fixtures/approved-panel.txt that Panel_Check performs,
#   - the BOM-free single JSON array EMQX requires in tooling/emqx/auth-bootstrap.json,
#   - anything copied into a Linux container, including the two Dockerfiles.
# The reference repository has no .gitattributes; this is a deliberate addition.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.riv binary
*.bin binary